OL,3,GNEWSADriver seriously hurt as van hits
OL,4,Astopped car on M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver suffered serious injuries when
OL,7,Fa van crashed into a stationary car on
OL,8,Fthe M1 in Derbyshire, police have said.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said the white Skoda
OL,11,FSuperb had stopped on lane three of the
OL,12,Fnorthbound carriageway near junction
OL,13,F29, when it was struck by a silver
OL,14,FVauxhall Vivaro van shortly after 09:00
OL,15,FBST on Monday.
OL,17,FThe Skoda driver was taken to hospital
OL,18,Fwhere he remains with serious injuries,
OL,19,Fwhile the Vauxhall driver stopped at
OL,20,Fthe scene and is assisting officers
OL,21,Fwith their inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
